      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• One active person submits 10 reviews each month. Both designs process the same workload.\n• Every review costs $0.012 in model calls. A fresh text extraction costs another $0.018.\n• After assumes that 20% of reviews can reuse extracted text. Every review still calls the model.\n• Always-on services incur cost even for one user. Component charges are rounded to cents.\n• Synthetic USD budget for the review path. Capacity assumptions are illustrative.",
      "originalText": "• One active person submits 10 reviews each month. Both designs process the same workload.\n• Every review costs $0.012 in model calls. A fresh text extraction costs another $0.018.\n• After assumes that 20% of reviews can reuse extracted text. Every review still calls the model.\n• Always-on services incur cost even for one user. Component charges are rounded to cents.\n• Synthetic USD budget for the review path. Capacity assumptions are illustrative.",
      "containerId": null
    },
