      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Replay a labeled set of scans through both paths. Compare missing text and feedback quality.\n• Trace upload, queue wait, extraction and review under one job ID to locate slow stages.\n• Track oldest pending job and Redis memory. Add workers when consumers fall behind.\n• Measure actual reuse and cost per completed review alongside the quality evaluation.",
      "originalText": "• Replay a labeled set of scans through both paths. Compare missing text and feedback quality.\n• Trace upload, queue wait, extraction and review under one job ID to locate slow stages.\n• Track oldest pending job and Redis memory. Add workers when consumers fall behind.\n• Measure actual reuse and cost per completed review alongside the quality evaluation.",
      "containerId": null
    },
